ONEDRAFT
CAD-AI — Aria Powered
Runtime & Application Orchestration Stack
Version 1.0
Status: Implementation Specification
Architecture: Service-Oriented Modular Monolith → Worker-Based Execution
Runtime: Python
API: REST / JSON
Database: PostgreSQL
Queue: Redis-backed job system
Workers: Python asynchronous workers
AI Layer: Aria Orchestration
Geometry Layer: Geometry Service
Compliance Layer: Regulatory Engine
Documentation Layer: Drawing / Document Engine
API Version: /api/v1

1. RUNTIME DESIGN PRINCIPLE
The OneDraft runtime is the execution layer between the external API and the persistent project model.
The runtime is responsible for transforming:
user intent
into:
validated domain operations
and ultimately:
versioned project state and derived documentation.
The runtime therefore becomes the computational control plane of OneDraft.
The fundamental execution path is:
CLIENT
 ↓
API GATEWAY
 ↓
APPLICATION SERVICE
 ↓
DOMAIN MODEL
 ↓
COMMAND BOUNDARY
 ↓
TRANSACTION
 ↓
JOB DISPATCH
 ↓
WORKER
 ↓
SPECIALIZED ENGINE
 ↓
VALIDATION
 ↓
MODEL FINALIZATION
 ↓
DOCUMENTATION

2. RUNTIME ARCHITECTURE
The initial runtime shall be implemented as a modular application rather than prematurely decomposed into independent microservices.
The initial architecture is:
apps/
├── api/
│   ├── routes
│   ├── middleware
│   ├── dependencies
│   └── application interface
│
├── worker/
│   ├── jobs
│   ├── queues
│   └── task execution
│
└── web/
    └── frontend
The domain and reusable application logic reside in:
packages/
├── domain/
├── application/
├── infrastructure/
├── geometry/
├── compliance/
├── documentation/
└── ai/
This prevents business logic from becoming trapped inside HTTP handlers.

3. APPLICATION LAYER
The application layer coordinates use cases.
It does not own raw database implementation.
It does not perform HTTP-specific logic.
It does not directly implement geometry algorithms.
It does not directly call an external AI provider.
Its responsibility is orchestration.
Examples:
CreateProject
CreateRequirement
CreateBuilding
CreateLevel
CreateSpace
CreateElement
ExecuteAriaCommand
CreateRevision
CreateRedline
ResolveRedline
RunValidation
GenerateDrawings
GenerateDocumentPackage
RecordAcceptance

